menu "VentureD Board C demo"

config VENTURED_ENCODER_INVERT_DIRECTION
    bool "Invert encoder direction"
    default n
    help
        Reverse the semantic clockwise/counter-clockwise events without
        changing Board C pin ownership.

config VENTURED_MIC_SLOT_RIGHT
    bool "Use I2S right slot for the digital microphone"
    default n
    help
        Board C documents WS/SD/SCK only. Left slot is the usual MEMS
        wiring (L/R to GND). Enable this if RMS stays 0 while speaking.

endmenu
